  "arrangerNotes": "Chorus, vocal line, transcribed by visual reading of the original 1927 Leo Feist sheet music (scan and LilyPond transcription saved in scores/b10/), key E flat major, cut time (durations in quarter-note beats); starts on the three-beat pickup. No substitutions: the chorus melody is entirely diatonic. Range low 5 to high 1. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
